 "guia": {
  "items": [],
  "texto": [
   "The Company provides guidance on a non-GAAP basis as we cannot predict certain elements which are included in reported GAAP results, including the impact of foreign exchange translation and commodity mark-to-market net impacts. PepsiCo’s current and previous fiscal 2026 outlook is summarized below.",
   "Fiscal 2026 Guidance ( changes are bolded & italicized below)",
   "Organic Revenue Approximately +3% +2% to +4%",
   "Foreign Exchange Translation (a)",
   "Approximately +1.5% to net revenue and core EPS growth Approximately +1% to net revenue and core EPS growth",
   "Acquisitions, net of Divestitures (b)",
   "Approximately +1.5% to net revenue growth Approximately +1% to net revenue growth",
   "Net Revenue Approximately +6% +4% to +6%"
  ],
  "titulo": "Guidance and Outlook",
  "fuente": "SEC EDGAR · 8-K, Exhibit 99.1 (texto original)",
  "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/77476/000007747626000050/q320268-kxexhibit991.htm",
  "texto_es": [
   "La compañía da su guía en términos no GAAP porque no puede prever algunos elementos incluidos en los resultados GAAP, como el efecto del tipo de cambio y las variaciones de valor de las materias primas. A continuación se resume la guía actual y la anterior de PepsiCo para el ejercicio 2026.",
   "Guía del ejercicio 2026 (los cambios van en negrita y cursiva)",
   "Ingresos orgánicos: aproximadamente +3% (antes, de +2% a +4%)",
   "Efecto del tipo de cambio (a)",
   "Aproximadamente +1,5% en el crecimiento de los ingresos netos y del BPA subyacente (antes, aproximadamente +1%)",
   "Adquisiciones netas de desinversiones (b)",
   "Aproximadamente +1,5% en el crecimiento de los ingresos netos (antes, aproximadamente +1%)",
   "Ingresos netos: aproximadamente +6% (antes, de +4% a +6%)"
  ]
 },
